Upstream-Name: motanka-stack-shell
Upstream-Contact: Ruslan Babych <1285978+digitwolf@users.noreply.github.com>
Source: https://github.com/digitwolf/motanka
Comment: The source package bundles the upstream components listed in
 stack/shell-components.tsv, one dpkg-source component per folder. The
 licence of each component below is a summary; the authoritative text is
 the LICENSE or COPYING file in the component's folder.

